WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.960
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:11.230 --> 00:14.460
[Ryu Se-il]

3
00:18.880 --> 00:22.340
[Ha Junghoon]

4
00:26.410 --> 00:29.660
[Lee Jungchan]

5
00:33.480 --> 00:36.980
[Jeong Siwan]

6
00:42.340 --> 00:47.020
[Boy, with Caution]

7
01:08.160 --> 01:09.130
Go.

8
01:10.570 --> 01:12.500
I'll pretend this never happened.

9
01:16.490 --> 01:17.520
I don't want to.

10
01:21.360 --> 01:23.140
Was what I did wrong?

11
02:15.940 --> 02:34.640
[Boy, with Caution] [Episode 5]

12
02:38.740 --> 02:41.829
Don't meddle when you're not going to follow through.

13
02:46.420 --> 02:47.820
Just this once for today.

14
02:47.880 --> 02:50.680
How many more damn "just this onces" will there be?

15
02:52.140 --> 02:53.620
Just send him away.

16
03:04.690 --> 03:07.750
I had a student in the past who really worried me as well.

17
03:07.790 --> 03:11.640
[2021]

18
03:16.740 --> 03:18.020
You slept here again?

19
03:21.780 --> 03:22.910
Get up.

20
03:38.520 --> 03:39.470
Mr. Jang.

21
03:41.920 --> 03:44.579
It's not even 7 AM, and you're already at school?

22
03:45.620 --> 03:46.880
It's not because of...

23
03:47.590 --> 03:48.610
me, right?

24
03:57.850 --> 03:59.380
Full Moon cream cake again?

25
03:59.420 --> 04:01.390
Don't you have anything else, like castella?

26
04:01.390 --> 04:02.850
When do you plan to go home?

27
04:06.210 --> 04:07.410
When I change my mind.

28
04:09.490 --> 04:10.580
Then...

29
04:11.150 --> 04:13.180
Wash your uniform at a laundromat.

30
04:14.080 --> 04:16.839
Wear your gym clothes to class today.

31
04:17.620 --> 04:18.620
Why?

32
04:19.720 --> 04:22.210
Do I... smell?

33
04:23.910 --> 04:25.250
A little.

34
04:30.740 --> 04:31.850
I'll go change.

35
04:37.640 --> 04:38.960
Oh, right, Mr. Jang.

36
04:39.000 --> 04:40.520
Keep the rest of the cake safe for me.

37
04:40.520 --> 04:41.780
I'll have it for lunch.

38
04:47.380 --> 04:49.100
She doesn't hate anyone,

39
04:49.540 --> 04:51.330
always keeping a smile on her face.

40
04:51.330 --> 04:52.240
Did you hear?

41
04:52.420 --> 04:53.000
What?

42
04:53.080 --> 04:54.800
She ran away from home and sleeps at school.

43
04:54.800 --> 04:56.909
Look at her gym clothes.

44
04:57.050 --> 04:58.830
Are those pajamas or what?

45
05:00.460 --> 05:01.710
Hey.

46
05:02.250 --> 05:03.650
I can hear you.

47
05:04.350 --> 05:06.420
If you wanna gossip, get your facts straight.

48
05:06.420 --> 05:08.100
These aren't pajamas.

49
05:08.830 --> 05:10.630
I sleep in my uniform.

50
05:14.670 --> 05:15.750
Jung Subin.

51
05:18.780 --> 05:22.800
Only I knew she was putting on a brave face.

52
05:26.870 --> 05:28.990
But I still pushed her.

53
05:30.860 --> 05:32.030
Subin.

54
05:35.370 --> 05:36.980
I called your mom.

55
05:40.790 --> 05:43.920
Go home after eating. I've logged your early dismissal.

56
05:46.630 --> 05:47.860
I don't want to.

57
05:50.830 --> 05:52.840
If I'm a hassle to you, just leave me alone.

58
05:52.840 --> 05:54.330
I'll figure it out myself.

59
05:55.470 --> 05:56.770
It's not like that.

60
05:56.950 --> 05:58.360
Then what's it like?

61
05:59.780 --> 06:02.240
Are you going to take care of me until the end?

62
06:02.480 --> 06:06.080
You're making me compromise because you can't handle it, right?

63
06:08.570 --> 06:10.560
It's neither this nor that, huh?

64
06:11.150 --> 06:12.660
My dad once said that

65
06:12.880 --> 06:15.740
being average is the hardest and least noticeable,

66
06:17.540 --> 06:19.350
and that's why it's dull.

67
06:20.440 --> 06:22.840
That's why everyone lives such a dull life.

68
06:24.390 --> 06:26.990
Looking at you, I finally know what that means.

69
06:32.060 --> 06:33.650
Go home after eating.

70
06:34.940 --> 06:36.360
Don't come to class.

71
06:52.440 --> 06:53.909
You met Jung Subin

72
06:54.070 --> 06:55.510
outside of school,

73
06:56.850 --> 06:59.170
privately, haven't you?

74
07:01.590 --> 07:02.950
Mr. Jang Kiwoo?

75
07:04.040 --> 07:06.470
Can I take your silence

76
07:07.160 --> 07:09.430
as a yes?

77
07:12.180 --> 07:16.880
Subin's going through something right now. I did meet her alone.

78
07:16.950 --> 07:18.640
But it's not...

79
07:19.250 --> 07:21.070
not what the rumors say.

80
07:22.060 --> 07:25.120
I was giving her advice about her family situation.

81
07:26.130 --> 07:28.350
Because she's living at school, right?

82
07:29.380 --> 07:29.990
Yes.

83
07:30.160 --> 07:31.560
You had no choice...

84
07:33.750 --> 07:35.530
I was the one who pushed her,

85
07:35.920 --> 07:37.040
but I played dumb.

86
07:37.230 --> 07:38.090
Yes.

87
07:44.510 --> 07:46.370
Actually, I did it all for myself,

88
07:47.670 --> 07:49.190
to protect myself.

89
07:49.850 --> 07:51.930
-Ms. Kim Sojung. -Yes?

90
07:52.050 --> 07:53.110
Can I have a minute?

91
07:58.580 --> 08:01.680
If Jung Subin is in class, please call her here.

92
08:01.950 --> 08:06.160
Um, Subin submitted a dropout application.

93
08:22.510 --> 08:24.910
This time, it's probably because of me too.

94
08:28.370 --> 08:30.530
"Regret," you think too much.

95
08:32.720 --> 08:34.740
I don't understand.

96
08:41.220 --> 08:43.570
How can affection be wrong?

97
08:57.660 --> 08:59.970
Do you really think it's all wrong?

98
09:10.410 --> 09:13.010
Was there not even a moment when you wavered,

99
09:14.110 --> 09:15.880
when you were swayed?

100
09:23.860 --> 09:25.570
I want to know.

101
09:30.210 --> 09:32.150
Think whatever you want.

102
09:34.790 --> 09:36.360
Can I?

103
09:41.370 --> 09:43.400
It's your imagination anyway.

104
09:56.890 --> 10:00.920
[Regret: I never wavered, nor was I ever swayed.]

105
10:15.060 --> 10:18.370
Then it should start now.

106
10:24.450 --> 10:25.650
I'm off.

107
10:27.400 --> 10:30.530
If I touch you again, you might actually swing at me, huh?

108
10:36.600 --> 10:37.780
Take it off.

109
10:38.380 --> 10:39.910
You look too good.

110
10:41.150 --> 10:42.720
You're not one of us.

111
10:45.430 --> 10:47.350
Cheap stuff suits you better.

112
10:56.570 --> 10:57.830
Hey, Vending Machine.

113
10:59.550 --> 11:01.960
If I call you that again, you might swing at me too, huh?

114
11:01.960 --> 11:03.020
You've got that right.

115
11:03.020 --> 11:03.830
Okay.

116
11:05.000 --> 11:07.620
The item of collateral you're getting from that dweeb today is worth 12 million.

117
11:07.620 --> 11:10.020
You want to borrow 10 million from me, right?

118
11:10.020 --> 11:11.140
And?

119
11:16.160 --> 11:18.360
If I sell you now, would I get 10 million?

120
11:24.110 --> 11:26.770
Stay sharp and get this transaction done right.

121
11:32.690 --> 11:34.090
Otherwise...

122
11:35.750 --> 11:38.350
this good hand of yours will be mine to ruin.

123
11:40.480 --> 11:41.630
Promise?

124
11:44.290 --> 11:45.900
It's a promise.

125
11:53.540 --> 11:55.400
Cram school should be over by now.

126
11:58.260 --> 11:59.520
Hey, Vending Machine.

127
12:04.810 --> 12:07.040
If you go soft, you're dead meat.

128
12:23.330 --> 12:24.510
Kim Jungha.

129
12:28.090 --> 12:30.290
You're here for the collateral, right?

130
12:30.970 --> 12:32.630
Did you decide to work for him?

131
12:33.280 --> 12:34.810
It's none of your business.

132
12:48.200 --> 12:49.390
It's not a knockoff, right?

133
12:49.390 --> 12:51.560
There's a Certificate of Authenticity too.

134
12:51.560 --> 12:54.300
I checked. This model costs 15 million.

135
12:58.120 --> 12:59.850
When will you wire me the money?

136
13:03.100 --> 13:05.140
You're doing this for drugs, right?

137
13:07.570 --> 13:09.110
You really should quit.

138
13:09.450 --> 13:11.180
When will you wire me the money?

139
13:12.660 --> 13:14.990
It'll be wired today after verification.

140
13:15.330 --> 13:17.790
As agreed, the repayment period is one week.

141
13:17.840 --> 13:19.060
With 20% interest.

142
13:26.010 --> 13:27.300
My mom's here.

143
13:28.240 --> 13:30.340
You must wire it to me today.

144
13:37.980 --> 13:39.390
Let's talk.

145
13:41.320 --> 13:42.800
I'm busy right now.

146
13:42.980 --> 13:44.980
Because of the part-time job again?

147
13:45.710 --> 13:47.160
Let's talk later.

148
14:02.210 --> 14:03.770
Pretty. My style.

149
14:04.070 --> 14:05.400
I'll wire the money now.

150
14:07.910 --> 14:10.440
Is there anyone selling drugs at your school?

151
14:10.700 --> 14:12.550
That dweeb doesn't look like the type to do drugs.

152
14:12.550 --> 14:15.660
Where did he even score them? How intriguing.

153
14:15.980 --> 14:17.120
There is.

154
14:18.250 --> 14:19.560
What's their name?

155
14:21.600 --> 14:24.880
Not gonna tell me? I was expelled for selling drugs there, you know?

156
14:24.880 --> 14:26.110
Lee Hyunjae.

157
14:36.050 --> 14:37.200
Lee Hyunjae?

158
14:40.450 --> 14:42.000
It's been a while.

159
14:43.800 --> 14:45.070
Does he go to school?

160
14:46.900 --> 14:47.900
Yes.

161
14:53.390 --> 14:54.560
Vending Machine.

162
14:55.440 --> 14:58.410
Right, you said you'd swing at me if I called you that again.

163
14:58.410 --> 14:59.540
Jungha.

164
15:00.450 --> 15:01.820
Go to school.

165
15:02.850 --> 15:05.510
Stop doing these piece-rate errands.

166
15:05.550 --> 15:07.480
Just help me take down Lee Hyunjae.

167
15:08.600 --> 15:12.060
If you can get me his phone, I'll wire you 10 million right away.

168
15:18.820 --> 15:21.480
You actually have the luxury of considering it?

169
15:22.790 --> 15:24.850
Or is there a reason holding you back?

170
15:39.560 --> 15:40.650
Okay.

171
15:41.470 --> 15:43.070
Lee Hyunjae did this, right?

172
15:43.630 --> 15:45.230
There's your reason to do it.

173
15:52.950 --> 15:54.410
Bring his phone tomorrow.

174
15:56.440 --> 15:58.170
It's for 10 million. (~$7,500)

175
15:58.880 --> 16:00.080
Keep that in mind.

176
16:17.090 --> 16:19.170
Has anyone contacted Jungha?

177
16:38.350 --> 16:39.720
Why are you late?

178
16:40.840 --> 16:42.480
I had to go to the hospital.

179
16:43.880 --> 16:45.170
I'm sorry.

180
16:48.160 --> 16:50.420
That's it for today's morning check-in.

181
17:22.869 --> 17:24.069
What is it?

182
17:27.640 --> 17:29.240
Do you have something to say?

183
17:30.940 --> 17:33.720
When is today's counseling?

184
17:37.740 --> 17:39.620
I was afraid you might forget.

185
17:45.130 --> 17:46.570
Where should we start?

186
17:49.260 --> 17:50.860
From that incident.

187
18:00.920 --> 18:02.580
Are you doing this on purpose?

188
18:09.560 --> 18:12.280
Otherwise, it'd be like it never happened.

189
18:15.710 --> 18:18.500
Didn't you say not to pretend something didn't happen when it did

190
18:18.500 --> 18:21.300
if you're not confident you can keep up the facade?

191
18:29.860 --> 18:33.040
If you don't like professional counselors, we can call off the counseling.

192
18:33.040 --> 18:33.890
Mr. Jang.

193
18:34.030 --> 18:35.500
Today's session is canceled.

194
18:35.500 --> 18:37.470
Starting next week, Ms. Lee Ga-eun will take over.

195
18:37.470 --> 18:38.620
You've met her before.

196
18:38.620 --> 18:39.410
Mr. Jang.

197
18:39.580 --> 18:41.300
So? Do you still want to continue

198
18:41.300 --> 18:42.550
with the counseling?

199
18:47.210 --> 18:48.320
No.

200
18:49.510 --> 18:50.910
Then it's settled.

201
18:53.610 --> 18:55.210
That's it?

202
19:08.800 --> 19:11.180
Because I'm not confident either,

203
19:13.420 --> 19:16.080
to pretend it didn't happen when it clearly did.

204
19:20.690 --> 19:22.800
I'm sorry if I gave you the wrong idea,

205
19:23.580 --> 19:25.730
but I hope you won't bring it up again.

206
19:32.490 --> 19:35.820
I wouldn't get the wrong idea about someone with a dull life.

207
19:41.890 --> 19:46.100
I thought I had to tell you this.

208
19:50.090 --> 19:51.330
You can go.

209
20:45.160 --> 20:46.760
Wire me the 10 million first.

210
20:47.560 --> 20:49.640
You sure are savvy.

211
20:50.130 --> 20:53.280
Just my style.

212
21:05.840 --> 21:08.190
Does this kid have no friends?

213
21:08.320 --> 21:09.610
Dad,

214
21:09.750 --> 21:10.940
Mom,

215
21:10.950 --> 21:11.600
Secretary,

216
21:11.600 --> 21:13.230
Teacher—Mr. Jang Kiwoo.

217
21:18.360 --> 21:19.650
[Amuna Random Chat]

218
21:25.150 --> 21:27.730
What do you think affection is?

219
21:28.000 --> 21:29.530
When do you feel affection?

220
21:32.600 --> 21:34.060
Jackpot. Something fun.

221
21:55.560 --> 21:56.750
Was it you?

222
21:57.890 --> 21:59.030
What?

223
21:59.410 --> 22:00.850
My phone.

224
22:01.680 --> 22:03.730
Why are you asking me for your phone?

225
22:04.060 --> 22:06.120
Didn't you send someone to beat me up?

226
22:07.220 --> 22:10.290
Him, your vending machine Kim Jungha.

227
22:10.670 --> 22:12.150
Did Kim Jungha say that?

228
22:18.570 --> 22:19.890
Answer me.

229
22:21.830 --> 22:23.080
Where's my phone?

230
22:23.220 --> 22:24.380
I really don't know.

231
22:24.500 --> 22:25.490
It wasn't me!

232
22:25.630 --> 22:28.070
What would I even do with your phone?

233
22:46.650 --> 22:47.820
Where's Kim Jungha?

234
22:57.790 --> 23:00.050
The nursing hospital must be expensive.

235
23:00.060 --> 23:02.490
Where did you get the money to transfer me?

236
23:03.670 --> 23:05.370
Of course I don't have the money.

237
23:05.370 --> 23:06.830
The government has money.

238
23:07.140 --> 23:09.790
You've lived here for so long. You must have a ton to throw away.

239
23:09.790 --> 23:12.120
You're transferring next week, you know?

240
23:12.830 --> 23:14.650
Is the government helping with the transfer?

241
23:14.650 --> 23:15.610
Of course.

242
23:17.510 --> 23:18.410
Have one.

243
23:18.560 --> 23:19.750
Ugh, no thanks.

244
23:20.000 --> 23:21.210
My teeth will hurt.

245
23:22.790 --> 23:24.040
It's very sweet.

246
23:31.380 --> 23:32.630
Let's go outside.

247
23:33.550 --> 23:35.320
Let's talk outside.

248
23:35.970 --> 23:37.260
Is he your friend?

249
23:37.450 --> 23:39.650
Ask him to come and eat some watermelon.

250
23:40.450 --> 23:42.900
Please, let's talk outside. Please.

251
23:47.040 --> 23:48.270
It was you, wasn't it?

252
23:50.510 --> 23:52.000
Kim Jitae.

253
23:52.740 --> 23:54.490
Kim Jitae made me do it.

254
23:55.830 --> 23:59.090
As soon as he heard your name, he told me to steal your phone.

255
24:01.600 --> 24:04.010
My grandmother doesn't know anything.

256
24:04.430 --> 24:05.810
So please, let's talk outside.

257
24:05.810 --> 24:07.050
The billiard hall?

258
24:15.600 --> 24:16.900
Grandma.

259
24:19.920 --> 24:21.630
Do you know that...

260
24:26.740 --> 24:30.070
Watermelon tastes better when stored at room temperature?

261
24:49.260 --> 24:52.230
Your friend is very polite.

262
24:54.200 --> 24:55.850
He's not my friend.

263
25:07.160 --> 25:09.130
"Regret," wanna meet?

264
25:10.710 --> 25:13.040
It's about time we meet.

265
25:15.350 --> 25:16.920
Why aren't you replying?

266
25:18.450 --> 25:19.800
Are you considering it?

267
25:32.520 --> 25:33.850
Where's Kim Jitae?

268
25:34.130 --> 25:35.160
Who are you?

269
25:35.350 --> 25:36.520
I asked you where he is.

270
25:36.520 --> 25:37.860
I asked who you are, idiot.

271
25:37.860 --> 25:38.990
Are you drunk?

272
25:39.330 --> 25:40.790
Call your boss and ask him.

273
25:40.890 --> 25:42.550
You just won't answer me, huh?

274
25:52.090 --> 25:53.500
He went out!

275
25:57.050 --> 25:57.950
Where did he go?

276
25:58.110 --> 25:59.700
He said he was meeting someone.

277
25:59.700 --> 26:00.410
Meet who?

278
26:00.540 --> 26:02.320
It's that chat app.

279
26:02.460 --> 26:04.420
He stole a phone, and said

280
26:04.550 --> 26:06.550
there was something fun on it.

281
26:06.720 --> 26:09.090
It's that ad that's always at the bus stops.

282
26:09.090 --> 26:10.790
Oh, Amuna Random Chat.

283
26:18.220 --> 26:19.460
Amuna Random Chat?

284
26:32.820 --> 26:34.580
You're Regret, right?

285
26:36.640 --> 26:37.990
Yes.

286
26:48.590 --> 26:50.120
Hello.

287
27:06.190 --> 27:11.570
[Boy, with Caution]

288
27:11.640 --> 27:13.360
I want to keep seeing you.

289
27:13.500 --> 27:15.000
How should I address you?

290
27:15.280 --> 27:16.420
What did you say to him?

291
27:16.420 --> 27:17.850
Is Jang Kiwoo that important to you?

292
27:17.850 --> 27:19.050
What has he been up to?

293
27:19.200 --> 27:20.230
Right now.

294
27:22.740 --> 27:24.070
You really are here.

295
27:24.770 --> 27:25.880
Lee Hyunjae.

296
27:26.110 --> 27:28.600
I did it because I like you.

297
27:29.590 --> 27:31.970
What do I have to do to make you stop?

298
27:32.180 --> 27:33.410
To give up on this?

299
27:34.630 --> 27:35.710
Congratulations.

300
27:35.870 --> 27:37.870
You finally have something to lose.

301
27:38.200 --> 27:40.270
He always had a dark side.

302
27:40.360 --> 27:42.580
Maybe because he grew up being abused at home.
